HOW IT WORKS
  1  It holds one subscription per relay (relays.txt, the same list nr-nostr posts to) for kind-1 notes that carry the bot's
     p tag. Every event is verified (id + BIP-340 signature) before it is looked at; anything older than 3 minutes, from
