  2  A note that MENTIONS the bot (nostr:npub..., nostr:nprofile..., or a fresh note with no thread) is a command:
        play <song>   ->  the ship's library first, then the V4V lane if it is on; a numbered list (max 6) as a reply
        random        ->  a hand from the ship's own sampler
        queue / now   ->  what is lined up / what is on air
        anything else ->  the help note, once an hour per person
  3  A reply to one of the bot's result notes that is a number, BY THE SAME PERSON, mints the invoice: the same checks as
     Telegram (one open invoice per person, no live session, nothing already lined up, deck not full), POST /api/play with
     the exact artist/title from the search (+ source/guid on the Wavlake lane), "who" = the requester's profile name.
